"media/argos-recognizes.jpg\",\n        \"label\": \"ARGOS\",\n        \"sub\": \"HIS OLD DOG\",\n        \"explains\": \"the old dog is the first in the house to recognise his master\",\n        \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odyssey\"\n      },\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"fit\": \"cover\", \"focus\": [0.587, 0.5], \"treatment\": \"duotone\" },\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/The_Odyssey_(Butler)/Book_XVII\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"04-scar\",\n      \"role\": \"clue\",\n      \"text\": \"His old nurse washes his feet and finds the scar a wild boar left.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит, как нянька держит ногу гостя над тазом, и кадр медленно съезжает к её руке на его колене — туда, где шрам.\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.6],\n      \"stage\": {\n        \"type\": \"media\",\n        \"src\": \"media/euryclea-scar.jpg\",\n        \"fit\": \"cover\",\n        \"focus\": [0.5, 0.5],\n        \"treatment\": \"duotone\",\n        \"crop\": { \"x\": 0, \"y\": 0, \"w\": 100, \"h\": 100 },\n        \"pan\": { \"to\": { \"x\": 30, \"y\": 32, \"w\": 48, \"h\": 48 }, \"at\": \"washes\", \"dur\": 2.6 }\n      },\n      \"devices\": [],\n      \"dominant\": \"stage\",\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"05-bow\",\n      \"role\": \"false-lead\",\n      \"text\": \"He strings his bow and shoots through [12|twelve] axes. Even then, Penelope fears a god in disguise.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит весь офорт: Одиссей натягивает лук, перед ним ряд колец, над листом счёт до «12 · AXES, ONE ARROW».\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.6],\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"src\": \"media/bow-twelve-rings.jpg\", \"fit\": \"contain\", \"treatment\": \"duotone\" },\n      \"devices\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"data.count\",\n          \"target\": { \"x\": 50, \"y\": 17 },\n          \"at\": \"twelve\",\n          \"params\": { \"to\": 12, \"label\": \"AXES, ONE ARROW\", \"size\": \"hero\", \"countDur\": 0.9 },\n          \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dominant\": 0,\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"06-bed\",\n      \"role\": \"reveal\",\n      \"text\": \"So she tests him: move our bed. It cannot move. One of its legs is a living olive tree.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит на тёмной карточке, как по словам появляются слова Одиссея у Батлера: «There was a young olive growing within the precincts of the house… I built my room round this».\",\n      \"pad\": [0.2, 0.9],\n      \"scene\": \"quote-card\",\n      \"at\": \"bed\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"text\": \"There was a young olive growing within the precincts of the house… I built my room round this\",\n        \"author\": \"Odysseus, Odyssey XXIII\",\n        \"year\": \"tr. 1900\",\n        \"size\": \"medium\",\n        \"source\": \"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/The_Odyssey_(Butler)/Book_XXIII\"\n      },\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"07-embrace\",\n      \"role\": \"ending\",\n      \"text\": \"After [20|twenty] years, a king was proven not by his bow, but by his bed.\",\n      \"sees\": \"Зритель видит, как Одиссей и Пенелопа обнимаются, а над листом в тишине встаёт «20 · YEARS».\",\n      \"pad\": [0.3, 2.2],\n      \"intent\": \"quiet-ending\",\n      \"target\": { \"x\": 50, \"y\": 16 },\n      \"at\": \"twenty\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"src\": \"media/penelope-embrace.jpg\",\n        \"value\": 20,\n        \"label\": \"YEARS\",\n        \"size\": \"hero\",\n        \"source\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\"\n      },\n      \"stage\": { \"type\": \"media\", \"fit\": \"contain\", \"treatment\": \"duotone\" },\n      \"dominant\": 0,\n      \"sources\": { \"text\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus\" }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"transitions\": [],\n  \"sound\": {\n    \"drone\": { \"peak\": \"06-bed:olive\", \"cut\": \"07-embrace:start\", \"volume\": 0.4, \"carve\": 0.65 },\n    \"hits\": [\n      { \"at\": \"02-suitors:start\", \"volume\": 0.4 },\n      { \"at\": \"03-argos:start\", \"volume\": 0.42 },\n      { \"at\": \"05-bow:start\", \"volume\": 0.45 },\n      { \"at\": \"06-bed:living\", \"heavy\": true, \"volume\": 0.58, \"carve\": 0.75 },\n      { \"at\": \"07-embrace:start\", \"volume\": 0.38 }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"music\": { \"track\": \"documentary-dark-01\" },\n  \"publish\": {\n    \"titles\": [\n      \"Twenty years gone: how Odysseus proved he was the king\",\n      \"Not the bow, the bed: how Penelope knew Odysseus after 20 years\",\n      \"108 suitors, one beggar: who recognised Odysseus first?\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"After twenty years away, Odysseus comes home to Ithaca disguised as a beggar, while 108 suitors court his wife. His old dog Argos knows him, his nurse finds the scar from a boar hunt, and he shoots through twelve axes — yet Penelope still fears a god in disguise. The proof is their bed: one of its legs is a living olive tree.\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"odyssey\",\n      \"homer\",\n      \"odysseus\",\n      \"penelope\",\n      \"greek mythology\",\n      \"ithaca\",\n      \"argos the dog\",\n      \"ancient greece\",\n      \"epic poetry\",\n      \"classics\",\n      \"theodoor van thulden\",\n      \"history shorts\",\n      \"mythology shorts\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":4688,"cache_read_input_tokens":152752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14149}}}
